# Markdown is not committed by default.
#
# This repository is the public face of a project whose design notes, audit trail and security
# research live in a separate private repository. Ignoring markdown wholesale means none of that
# can be published by an absent-minded `git add .`; publishing a document becomes a deliberate act
# with a visible negation below it.
#
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT negated. It is working instructions, not documentation.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md

# Agent instructions, same reasoning as CLAUDE.md above. Ignored here rather than relying on a
# global ignore, which is not present in someone else's checkout.
.claude/

/target/
**/target/
node_modules/
.env
logs/

# Scratch directories used by the test harness when comparing against upstream.
/tmp/
